;SYNTHETIC BIVALENT HUPA-LIKE DIMER, (S, S)-(-)-BIS(12)-HUPYRIDONE ((S, S)-(-)-N, N'-DI-5'- -[5', 6', 7', 8'-TETRAHYDRO-2'(1'H)-QUINOLINONYL] 1, 12-DIAMINODODECANE) DIHYDROCHLORIDE, WITH ONE MONOMER UNIT BOUND TO THE 'ANIONIC' SUBSITE, NEAR THE BOTTOM OF THE ACTIVE SITE GORGE, AND THE SECOND MONOMER UNIT BOUND TO THE 'PERIPHERAL' ANIONIC SITE AT THE TOP OF THE GORGE, THUS SPANNING THE ACTIVE SITE GORGE.
;
